From e16f3820490db96322ca088f628068b57b4d62f4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 02:07:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] retain refusal stops when decision notice
 publication fails

Use the existing safe publisher inside reclaim so a notification outage cannot roll back the durable stop or other dead-worker progress. Resolve uid-less restricted episodes by their existing id fallback; reuse the prior supervisor route, never issue another execution allowance.

Proof: actual child interpreter -> writer -> detect_crashed_workers regressions RED 3/3 before, GREEN after; 12 focused control files pass with retries disabled. Seven independent provenance/release/notice mutants killed. No provider call or original incident mutation. Addresses review6009581388 on PR3996.
